---
// Default Privacy Policy — plain and general-purpose, filled from site.ts
// (practice name, domain, phone, email, address). It covers: analytics and
// marketing tracking; personal information collected to answer inquiries and
// contact prospective clients; personal information never sold. Ship it as-is
// unless the client supplies their own policy (theirs always wins), and
// adjust the bullets if the client's tools differ. Update effectiveDate
// whenever the text changes.
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHeaderBanner from "../components/PageHeaderBanner.astro";
import { getSiteInfo } from "../lib/data/site";
import { phoneHref } from "../lib/utils/phone";

const site = await getSiteInfo();
const effectiveDate = "[Month DD, YYYY]"; // set at launch
const telHref = phoneHref(site);
const siteHost = new URL(site.url || "https://example.com").hostname;
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description={`How ${site.practiceName} collects, uses, and protects your information.`}>
  <PageHeaderBanner eyebrow="Legal" heading="Privacy Policy" />
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="legal__body">
      <p class="legal__effective">Effective {effectiveDate}</p>
      <p>{site.practiceName} ("we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect when you visit {siteHost} (the "Site") or contact us, how we use it, and the choices you have. By using the Site, you agree to the practices described here.</p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <h3>Information you give us</h3>
      <p>When you fill out a form, request an appointment, call, text, or email us, you may share information such as:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your name, email address, and phone number</li>
        <li>Your pet's name, species, breed, and details about their health or care</li>
        <li>Any other information you choose to include in your message</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
      <p>Like most websites, the Site automatically collects certain technical information when you visit, including your IP address, browser and device type, pages viewed, time spent on pages, the website that referred you, and general location (such as city). We collect this through cookies, pixels, and similar technologies, as described below.</p>

      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to your questions and inquiries</li>
        <li>Contact you about our services, schedule appointments, and follow up as a prospective or current client</li>
        <li>Provide our services and support</li>
        <li>Understand how visitors use the Site so we can improve it</li>
        <li>Measure and improve our marketing and advertising efforts</li>
        <li>Keep the Site secure and comply with legal obligations</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Analytics, Cookies, and Marketing</h2>
      <p>We use analytics and marketing tools, which may include services such as Google Analytics and advertising platforms like Google and Meta (Facebook and Instagram), to understand how visitors find and use the Site and to measure the effectiveness of our marketing. These tools may place cookies or similar technologies on your device and may be used to show you relevant ads on other websites and social media.</p>
      <p>You can control cookies through your browser settings, including blocking or deleting them. You can also opt out of Google Analytics with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>, and learn more about interest-based advertising choices at <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">optout.aboutads.info</a>. Blocking cookies may affect how some parts of the Site work.</p>

      <h2>We Never Sell Your Personal Information</h2>
      <p>We do not sell, rent, trade, or otherwise distribute your personal information to anyone for their own marketing or any other purpose. We share information only with service providers who help us operate the Site and our business (for example, website hosting, form handling, scheduling, email, and analytics providers). They may use it only to perform services for us. We may also disclose information if required by law or to protect our rights or the safety of others.</p>

      <h2>Third-Party Links and Services</h2>
      <p>The Site may link to or embed third-party services, such as online scheduling, forms, and social media pages. Those services have their own privacy policies, and we are not responsible for their practices. We encourage you to review their policies.</p>

      <h2>How Long We Keep Information</h2>
      <p>We keep personal information only as long as needed for the purposes described in this policy, such as responding to your inquiry, providing services, and meeting legal or business record-keeping requirements.</p>

      <h2>How We Protect Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use reasonable administrative and technical measures to protect your information. No method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

      <h2>Your Choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>You can ask us to access, correct, or delete the personal information you've shared with us.</li>
        <li>You can ask us to stop contacting you at any time by replying to our message or contacting us using the details below.</li>
        <li>You can manage cookies and ad preferences as described above.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>The Site is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us and we will delete it.</p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will post the updated version on this page and change the effective date above.</p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your information, contact us:</p>
      <address class="legal__contact">
        <strong>{site.practiceName}</strong><br />
        {site.address && <>{site.address}<br /></>}{site.addressLine2 && <>{site.addressLine2}<br /></>}
        Phone: <a href={telHref}>{site.phoneNumber}</a><br />
        Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
      </address>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal { max-inline-size: var(--container-max-narrow); margin-inline: auto; padding: var(--space-xl) var(--space-md); }
  .legal__effective { color: var(--text-muted); }
  .legal__contact { padding: var(--space-lg); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--solid-bg); border-inline-start: 2px solid var(--cta); font-style: normal; line-height: 1.8; }
</style>
